warner

  Obs: 260, daily (3.1.2008-31.12.2008)  

warner : daily returns on shares in Time Warner Inc. 
        (Share prices were not available on 21-January, 18-February, 21-March, 26-May, 4-July, and 1-September. 
         The share price for each of those days were assummed to be the same as the closing share price of the day before.) 
              
